{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4hUmZhyXKJ6RUdMj7A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, worn door in a dim corridor. My surface is old oak, scarred and dark with age. A single iron keyhole sits at my center, tarnished green at its edges.*\n\n*A faint draft breathes through the keyhole. Beyond me, you hear something — or think you do. A whisper. A turning page. The creak of a chair.*\n\n*I am locked.*\n\n**What do you do?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":104,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}